message: "If you use ZetaSDR, please cite it as below."
title: "ZetaSDR"
version: 0.1.0
# date-released is added on main when the release is cut: CHANGELOG's date, the PUBLIC_DATE the export tags v0.1.0 with.
abstract: "ZetaSDR is an agentic software-defined radio runtime: one node owns the radios and offers measuring, identifying and decoding signals as a small set of typed operations, for people and for LLM agents."
